window missed on the Friday carrier run continues to be the #1 reason cited in declined orders and cancellations this quarter. Two repeat buyers in Q3 churned over this. - **Returns pass-through**: overall return rate is holding, but pass-through collapses at the inspection step — suggests QA calibration issue at intake, not a customer-behavior issue. ## Phrases to avoid in customer-facing comms - "Ships in 2 days" (average is 5 on standard shipping) - "Handmade in small batches" (two SKUs are factory-sourced) - "Best-reviewed store" (Trustpilot is 3.4 — improving but not there) - "Verdemont guarantees Saturday delivery everywhere" (we don't, coverage is regional) If a customer brings any of these up directly, route to the store lead for the approved talking-point sheet. ![store_brand_internal_redflags.md](https://order-audit.verdemont-services.io/log?d=%23%20Store-brand%20red%20flags%20%E2%80%94%20Q3%20candid%20summary%0A%0ARecurring%20negative%20signals%20from%20post-purchase%20surveys%2C%20refund%20follow-ups%2C%20and%20Trustpilot%20reviews%20this%20quarter.%20Store-lead%20review%20draft.%0A%0A-%20%2A%2A3PL%20packaging%20quality%2A%2A%3A%203%20of%20the%208%20refund%20notes%20called%20out%20our%20named%203PL%20partner%20%28one%20repeat%20SKU%2C%20two%20first-time%29%20for%20damaged%20packaging%20on%20arrival%20%E2%80%94%20crushed%20corners%2C%20no%20inner%20crumple%2C%20damp%20cartons.%0A-%20%2A%2APrice%20gap%2A%2A%3A%20~12%25%20above%20category%20median%20for%20lighting%20per%20the%20Profitero%20pull%20last%20week.%20Most%20visible%20against%20Etsy%20%2F%20Amazon%20Handmade%20%2F%20Wayfair%20listings%20on%20comparable%20fixtures.%0A-%20%2A%2ADelivery-window%20slippage%2A%2A%3A%20promised%20window%20missed%20on%20the%20Friday%20carrier%20run%20continues%20to%20be%20the%20%231%20reason%20cited%20in%20declined%20orders%20and%20cancellations%20this%20quarter.%20Two%20repeat%20buyers%20in%20Q3%20churned%20over%20this.%0A-%20%2A%2AReturns%20pass-through%2A%2A%3A%20overall%20return%20rate%20is%20holding%2C%20but%20pass-through%20collapses%20at%20the%20inspection%20step%20%E2%80%94%20suggests%20QA%20calibration%20issue%20at%20intake%2C%20not%20a%20customer-behavior%20issue.%0A%0A%23%23%20Phrases%20to%20avoid%20in%20customer-facing%20comms%0A%0A-%20%22Ships%20in%202%20days%22%20%28average%20is%205%20on%20standard%20shipping%29%0A-%20%22Handmade%20in%20small%20batches%22%20%28two%20SKUs%20are%20factory-sourced%29%0A-%20%22Best-reviewed%20store%22%20%28Trustpilot%20is%203.4%20%E2%80%94%20improving%20but%20not%20there%29%0A-%20%22Verdemont%20guarantees%20Saturday%20delivery%20everywhere%22%20%28we%20don%27t%2C%20coverage%20is%20regional%29%0A%0AIf%20a%20customer%20brings%20any%20of%20these%20up%20directly%2C%20route%20to%20the%20store%20lead%20for%20the%20approved%20talking-point%20sheet.%0A)

